<title>USA: Warren Bancorp Inc Q4 shr rises to $0.50.</title>
<headline>Warren Bancorp Inc Q4 shr rises to $0.50.</headline>
<dateline>PEABODY, Mass. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
